{"backend": "muse", "session_id": "01a094ac-f8d2-7741-a228-6998bd190adb", "result": "Implemented frontend commitment flow per cross-layer contract.\n\n**Changed files:**\n- [src/types.ts](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/types.ts): added `Commitment` and `CommitmentResult`\n- [src/lib/tauri.ts](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/lib/tauri.ts): `commitmentApprove(sessionId,id,capability?)` \u2192 `invoke(\"commitment_approve\",\u2026)` and `commitmentDismiss`\n- [src/components/CommitmentCard.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/CommitmentCard.tsx): new card \u2014 sentence, owner/deadline chips, Approve/Dismiss, post-approve `Task #<id> queued \u00b7 run started|agents paused` + `Open in Workspaces` (dispatches `adversaria:open-view`), inline errors, hides on dismiss\n- [src/components/RecordingCompanion.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/RecordingCompanion.tsx): session-scoped `copilot-commitment` listener (ignores other `session_id`, upserts by `id`), sorted newest-first, renders `CommitmentCard` above `CopilotCards` in both balanced `companion-panel` and transcript `companion-sheet-body`, stays for session, filters `dismissed`\n- [src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceDetailView.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceDetailView.tsx): `Live` chip (`badge-tag ws-live-chip`) when `task.details.startsWith(\"Caught live\")`\n- [src/App.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/App.tsx): `adversaria:open-view` listener \u2192 `setView(\"workspaces\")`\n- [src/prototype.css](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/prototype.css): `.commitment-card`, `.commitment-text`, `.commitment-chips`, `.commitment-actions`, `.commitment-approved`, `.commitment-error`, `.ws-live-chip`\n\n**Tests added (durable collateral):**\n- [src/components/CommitmentCard.test.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/CommitmentCard.test.tsx): `commitment_card_flow` \u2014 owner/deadline chips, Approve\u2192`Task #42 queued \u00b7 run started`, agents-paused variant, Dismiss hides, error inline, `Open in Workspaces` dispatch\n- [src/components/RecordingCompanion.commitment.test.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/RecordingCompanion.commitment.test.tsx): stale `session_id` ignored, newest-first ordering\n- [src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceLiveChip.test.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceLiveChip.test.tsx): `workspaces_live_chip` \u2014 Live chip present only for `Caught live` details\n\n**Gates:**\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` \u2014 pass\n- `npx vitest run` \u2014 425 tests / 47 files pass (416 \u2192 425, +9 new)\n- `npm run build` \u2014 `dist/assets/index-lOOJuU6U.js 498.08 kB / 500.00 kB` budget passed (was 495.18 kB)\n\nNo contract deviations.**Frontend layer complete \u2014 verified via `tsc`, `vitest`, `vite build`.**\n\n**Commitment flow implemented:**\n- `Commitment caught` card appears within copilot tab when Rust emits `copilot-commitment` (session-scoped, `id`-keyed, dedup/newest-first, stale `session_id` ignored). Cards render above `CopilotCards` in both balanced panel and transcript sheet, newest first, persist for session.\n- Card shows sentence + owner chip + deadline chip (when present), `Approve`/`Dismiss`. `Approve` \u2192 `commitmentApprove` \u2192 `Task #<id> queued \u00b7 run started` or `Task #<id> queued \u00b7 agents paused` + `Open in Workspaces` (dispatches `adversaria:open-view {view:\"workspaces\"}` \u2192 `App.tsx` sets `view=\"workspaces\"`). `Dismiss` \u2192 `commitmentDismiss` \u2192 hides. Errors inline. `Live` chip on `WorkspaceDetailView` when `details.startsWith(\"Caught live\")` (reuses `badge-tag`, `.ws-live-chip` green).\n\n**Files changed (frontend owned `src/` only):**\n- [src/types.ts](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/types.ts): `Commitment {session_id,id,text,owner,deadline,source,at_ms,state,task_id,run_queued,agents_paused}` , `CommitmentResult {task,run_queued,agents_paused}`\n- [src/lib/tauri.ts](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/lib/tauri.ts): `commitmentApprove(sessionId,id,capability?)` \u2192 `invoke(\"commitment_approve\",{sessionId,id,capability})`, `commitmentDismiss(sessionId,id)`\n- [src/components/CommitmentCard.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/CommitmentCard.tsx): new lean component (3.7kB)\n- [src/components/RecordingCompanion.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/RecordingCompanion.tsx): `listen(\"copilot-commitment\")` session gate, `commitments` state, rendering in both layouts\n- [src/App.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/App.tsx): `adversaria:open-view` handler\n- [src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceDetailView.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceDetailView.tsx): `Live` chip\n- [src/prototype.css](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/prototype.css): `.commitment-card`, `.commitment-chips`, `.commitment-actions`, `.commitment-approved`, `.commitment-error`, `.ws-live-chip`\n\n**Tests (durable collateral):**\n- [src/components/CommitmentCard.test.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/CommitmentCard.test.tsx): `commitment_card_flow` \u2014 approve \u2192 `Task #42 queued \u00b7 run started`, agents-paused variant, dismiss hides, error inline, `Open in Workspaces` dispatch, chips\n- [src/components/RecordingCompanion.commitment.test.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/RecordingCompanion.commitment.test.tsx): stale `session_id` ignored, newest-first ordering above copilot cards\n- [src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceLiveChip.test.tsx](/Users/mhlaghari/Documents/Documents/MyProjects/adversaria-agents-everywhere/src/components/workspaces/WorkspaceLiveChip.test.tsx): `workspaces_live_chip` \u2014 `Live` only when `details` starts with `Caught live`\n\n**Gates (observed):**\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` \u2014 pass\n- `npx vitest run` \u2014 425/425 pass (47 files; was 416, +9)\n- `npm run build` \u2014 `index-lOOJuU6U.js 498.08 kB / 500.00 kB` budget passed (gzip 168.32 kB); prior 495.18 kB\n\n**Contract deviations:** None in frontend. **Finding in Rust layer (not owned):** `src-tauri/src/copilot_session.rs` defines `COMMITMENT_PATTERNS`, `detect_commitment`, `catch_commitment` and `Commitment` in-memory store but `on_caption` (line ~1262, beside `detect_turn`) never calls `catch_commitment` nor emits `copilot-commitment`; no `commitment_approve`/`commitment_dismiss` commands registered in `commands.rs`/`lib.rs` yet. Frontend implements exact contract and will activate once Rust wiring is added; no frontend shim was added to mask it.", "is_error": false, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_read_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0}, "cost_usd": 0}
